  "productSlug": "haloitsm",
  "shortDescription": "HaloITSM (Halo) is an all-in-one ITSM / employee service-desk platform (incidents, requests, assets, and adjacent PSA-style packaging) from Halo Service Solutions. The first-party UK pricing calculator shows about £66/agent/month billed annually as the published all-in-one floor — treat as GBP, not a USD list. Onboarding packages are extra. Same itsm-service-desk cluster as ServiceNow and Freshservice — this entity does not outrank ServiceNow 8.7 or Freshservice 8.4. Distinct from SysAid’s quote-led ~$89 listing and from ManageEngine’s $13 Standard floor.",
